<tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/tachanun/vaanachnu">
<tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/tachanun/vaanachnu/text"/>
<tei:seg corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/tachanun/vaanachnu/vaanachnu" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_2/20/12">We know not what to do, but our eyes are upon thee. </tei:seg>
<tei:seg corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/tachanun/vaanachnu/zekhor" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/25/6">Remember thy mercy and thy kindness, O Lord, for they are eternal. </tei:seg>
<tei:seg corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/tachanun/vaanachnu/yehi" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/22">May thy kindness rest on us, O Lord, as our hope rests on thee. </tei:seg>
<tei:seg corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/tachanun/vaanachnu/al_tizkor" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/79/8">O mind not our former iniquities; may thy compassion hasten to our aid, for we are brought very low. </tei:seg>
<tei:seg corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/tachanun/vaanachnu/chonenu" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/123/3">Take pity on us, O Lord, take pity on us, for we are exceedingly sated with contempt. </tei:seg>
<tei:seg corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/tachanun/vaanachnu/berogez" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:habakkuk/3/2">When in wrath, remember to be merciful. </tei:seg>
<tei:seg corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/tachanun/vaanachnu/ki_hu" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/103/14">He knows what we are made of, remembering that we are but dust. </tei:seg>
<tei:seg corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/tachanun/vaanachnu/ozrenu" source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/79/9">Help us, our saving God, for the sake of thy glorious name; rescue us and pardon our sins for thy name’s sake.</tei:seg>
</tei:p>
</tei:div>
